Line-by-line explanation:
   1  ifenemy 0 19     enemy dead ahead then attack block
   2  ifenemy 45 15    enemy front-right then turn right to face it
   3  ifenemy 315 17   enemy front-left then turn left to face it
   4  write r3 0       reset r3 for newly infected critters
   5  ifgt r1 r3 9     if there are steps left in this leg then keep walking
   6  write r1 5       otherwise start a new leg of 5 steps
   7  ifrandom 17      beginning with a turn, left or right at random
   8  go 15
   9  ifwall 0 15      wall or obstacle ahead then turn
  10  ifempty 0 12     path clear then walk
  11  go 17            blocked by another critter then turn
  12  dec r1           one step off this leg
  13  hop
  14  go 1
  15  right            turn right then rescan next turn
  16  go 1
  17  left             turn left then rescan next turn
  18  go 1
  19  ifhungry 22      eating if hungry, otherwise infect
  20  infect 1         convert the enemy, have it start at line 1 scanning
  21  go 1
  22  eat              resets hunger and grants the boost
  23  go 1


